      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "text": "GUI shows every control; unsupported ones are grayed out with the reason, never hidden.",
      "why": "User wants to see what their hardware can't do and why.",
      "node": "A2"
    },
    {
      "id": "D2",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "text": "Everything stays local. No cloud, no telemetry — at least for now.",
      "why": "",
      "node": null
    },
    {
      "id": "D3",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "text": "Write our own code first; borrow from open source only if our attempt fails.",
      "why": "It's a learning project.",
      "node": null
    },
    {
      "id": "D4",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "text": "Target any Linux distro, not just GNOME/Ubuntu.",
      "why": "",
